Over the past few days, the relevant departments of the county have also implemented 2.838 million yuan for more than 690 poor college students.
At the same time, for the family's economic situation is particularly difficult, it is also helped to complete their studies through the form of organizing social donations.
This year's integrated student aid funds of more than 18.5 million yuan, financial self-financing more than 2.5 million yuan, by the financial department in accordance with the prescribed time limit into the real-name bank card of poor students.
She said gratefully: "I thought my father was dead, and my brother and I couldn't go to college, and I didn't expect the county to solve our difficulties in time."
As of August 8, Huayuan has implemented more than 21 million yuan of various rescue funds for 13,140 poor students in the first half of this year.
All the poor students in this county have realized that they should do their best to help and make up for the supplement.
