In the collective greenhouse of Donglin Village in Taicang City, 48-year-old Wang Xuefen is taking workers to spray pear trees with pesticides.
There are 150 acres of orchards and more than 10 tree species in the village, requiring only 12 workers and 1 technical engineer.
Last year's total of 50,000 yuan, like my age, if you work in the factory will not get this money.
Last year, Donglin Village's village income reached 22 million yuan, of which the total agricultural income accounted for nearly half.
