Xiamen girl Zhang Bingbin: "Beautiful hands" began to shoot the road career several times "reversed"
A few days ago, Zhang Donghong of Dongyuan Village in Xiang'an District of Xiamen had just replaced the 29-inch old TV at home with a 65-inch TV.
The daughter of this ordinary farmer is Zhang Binbin, who won the silver medal in the women's 50-meter rifle final for China at the Rio Olympics on the evening of the 11th.
On the evening of the 11th, just before this new TV, Zhang Donghong and dozens of relatives and friends witnessed the magical process of her daughter catching up all the way, from the almost preliminaries to the magical process of almost reversing.
In the game on the same day, Zhang Binbin once ranked in the middle and lower reaches, it seems very far away from the final.
However, the parents and relatives and friends did not give up, kept brushing the text live, and saw that with the completion of the competition of other players, Zhang Binbin improved all the way, and finally locked up the final seat, and his home suddenly broke out from a wave of cheers.
In the final, Zhang Binbin was at the bottom of the ranking, and the last few shots became more and more stable, and only won the silver medal with a score of 0.2 rings behind the championship.
This year, 27-year-old Zhang Binbin, in his 16-year shooting career, in fact, almost passed this hard-won silver medal several times.
His mother Zhang Xiaolong told reporters that when they hesitated, Zhang Binbin found several "novel guests" in the same village.
These "novels" are the same village children who were recommended to participate in training at the same time, including Zhang Binbin's cousin.
Shortly after entering the Xiamen team, Zhang Binbin once took the initiative to return to Xiang'an's school because of family difficulties and other reasons.
However, after his Enlightenment coach Zhang Yajie repeatedly did his work, Zhang Binbin returned to the Xiamen team.
After entering the provincial team, Zhang Binbin once returned home again because he could not enter the national team because he could not find hope.
This time, not only coach Zhang Yajie, Xiamen shooting archery sports center and Fujian provincial team leaders and coaches came home, and finally persuaded Zhang Binbin to return to the provincial team.
Just like yesterday's game, the Xiamen girl's insistence to achieve a reversal on the road of shooting.
"Each coach's way of selecting players is different, when I saw that the hand was very beautiful, and it came out all at once."
Zhang Donghong also recalled that in the training test, although the daughter's performance is not the best, but the number of rings played is very stable, which is also an important reason for Zhang Binbin to attract coaches.
In the process of training Zhang Binbin, Zhang Yajie was most impressed by the input of the peasant girl.
He recalled that more than a year after Zhang Binbin entered the Xiamen shooting team, the team carried out the long-lasting shooting training, and asked the team members not to move for half an hour.
Zhang Xiaolong told reporters that her daughter has always been a quiet and well-behaved child, and likes to paint and make handmade toys from an early age.
"It turns out that I will make clothes at home, sewn and make up, and I'll pick up some corners to make my own dolls."
She said that her daughter will often sew her own handmade toys, plus she is good at painting, from the doll's five senses to clothing, can always do life.
As an athlete, Zhang Binbin and his family gathered more and more, only on holidays to go home, usually rely on the telephone contact.
The parents said that whether it is to meet or call, Zhang Binbin rarely said that his hard work, but also to talk to his parents about some happy things.
Usually can not see the daughter, the parents at home the daughter's childhood paintings and years of honor are carefully stored.
Zhang Xiaolong showed his daughter's anime paintings to reporters, "If she is not a shooter, she should continue to paint."
In the living room on the second floor of Zhang Binbin's house, there is a cabinet filled with the medals, medals and certificates she received.
Zhang Donghong put medals and medals neatly placed, and the certificate was uniformly put into the folder for preservation, "These are the honors of more than ten years of hard work, which we all cherish."
