Some media said that during the production of iPhone7, Taiwan suffered several earthquakes, "TSMC's production facilities are more damaged than expected, and may have an impact on the initial iPhone 7 supply."
The contradiction between supply and demand will affect ordinary users, it is time to choose a good channel, the first time to start the original iPhone 7.
According to people familiar with the matter, in the near future, Suning's top executives and Apple meet frequently, in order to prepare sufficient supplies.
The operator has negotiated with Suning, it is foreseeable that with the deep cooperation between the two sides, it will inevitably bring lower prices and more intimate services to users.
"At the lowest price, consumers may be able to buy an iPhone 7 for just $7 a day."
Adequate supply and a variety of offers, so that the purchase of iPhone7 is no longer "pressure mountains", and Suning's logistics will turn this beauty into a more intuitive sense of experience.
