The park consists of more than 100 circular small ponds, planting about 300 varieties of ornamental lotus, water lilies and so on.
The rural lotus industry has both ornamentality, leisure and economic benefits, and has become the highlight of local new rural development.
According to foreign media reports, due to diving pool water from blue to green, the Rio Olympic "green pool" event has recently attracted much attention from the outside world.
However, on the morning of the 10th, the water of the pollium playing pool adjacent to the diving pool also turned green.
Australian water polo players said after the game that his eyes felt tingling and wanted to shed tears.
Previously, the official staff of the Rio Olympics confirmed that the pool water turned green, and said that the change of color in the pool water was due to the weakening of alkalinity, which would not affect the health of the athletes.
But Australian athletes said their eyes stung after a victory with the Japanese team in the poll pool.
At the earliest, after the diving pool water turned green, the competition organizers worked overtime on the evening of the 9th to deal with the problem of diving pools, but on the morning of the 10th, it was found that the color of the poll pool also changed rapidly.
During the match between Australia and the Japanese team, the environmental conditions of the pool gradually deteriorated, but the official stressed that they would restore the water quality of the two swimming pools to their original colors on the 11th.
Mario Andrada, a spokesman for the Rio Olympics, said: “Yesterday’s afternoon, the level of water alkalinity in the diving pool was weaker in the first place.”
“We learned about a range of factors that may cause discoloration of pool water, as well as the alkalinity of water quality.”
A series of tests were carried out for water quality, and hundreds of divers and swimmers used the pool to determine the water quality conditions.”
“We’ve been going through normal procedures these days, but we’ve probably overlooked the more athletes that could have an impact on water quality.”
“But changes in the color of the water certainly have no effect on good health, especially for athletes.”
“This independent team confirmed our assessment and confirmed the measures taken to restore the swimming pool to its normal color and to its normal state of chemistry.”
“We had hoped that the pool would return to normal color in the morning, but the rate of recovery due to the rain was affected.”
According to Taiwan's "Central News Agency" reported that a prison on the outskirts of the Greater Manila area exploded last night, resulting in the injury of the warden and the death of 10 prisoners, including two Chinese.
ABS-CBN television reported that the incident took place at Paranaque prison at around 9 a.m. last night, but police did not make a preliminary statement until 2 a.m. until today.
The police said that the 10 prisoners were asked to meet with the warden and complained about the transfer, but the two sides did not speculate, and some prisoners threw grenades, resulting in an explosion.
Prisons have not yet released the names of the dead prisoners, but GMA television reported, including two Chinese.
As at 8 a.m., no detailed information had been provided by the prison authorities, including how the prisoners obtained the grenades.
Yesterday, the police in the central Philippines entered Leyte district prison and killed a person who had "attempted to attack the police".
Urumqi regulates the operation order of the tourist market, and travel agencies must sign contracts with tourists
At present, Xinjiang has entered the peak tourist season, in order to standardize the operation order of the tourism passenger market, Urumqi Tourism Law Enforcement Detachment Joint Municipal Transport Administration Law Enforcement Detachment yesterday on the existence of tourist vehicles in the passenger market is not standardized, travel agencies and tourists have a low contract rate and other issues.
At eight o'clock yesterday morning, about 10 buses were parked around the Kempinski Hotel, most of which were full of tourists.
"Hello, I'm from the Urumqi City Tourism Bureau, have you signed a contract with this travel agency?"
Yu Bin, a staff member of the law enforcement detachment of the Urumqi Municipal Transportation Management Bureau, said: "There are still tourist vehicles and line cars operating tourism passenger projects in the Urumqi market, and there is no qualification."
"Exceeding the scope of the operation of this penalty of three to 100,000 fines, the driver does not have a qualification certificate is a fine of 2,000 yuan."
It is understood that before Urumqi city tourism law enforcement departments have carried out inspections of West Park, Red Mountain and other places with a concentration of tourists.
In summary of the two inspections, Ma Qi, deputy captain of the tourism law enforcement detachment in Urumqi, said: "The first is safety, the second is the specification, the tourism vehicle is no small matter, and once the problem is, the group is killed."
“We jointly and continuously inspect the market and regulate the travel agency's car behavior to ensure the safety of tourists."
On the morning of August 12, the Information Office of the State Council held a press conference on the operation of the national economy in July 2016.
Sheng Laiyun, spokesman of the National Bureau of Statistics and director of the Department of Comprehensive Statistics of the National Economy, said that in July, the growth rate of some indicators of the national economy slowed down, but it was still operating within a reasonable range.
According to the data released by the National Bureau of Statistics, the growth rate of fixed asset investment and total imports fell in July.
Regarding the operation of the national economy in July, I would like to use the words of the prime minister that "there are fluctuations, the situation is still good", which can better summarize the characteristics of the economic operation in July.
He explained that "shaped fluctuations" means that the growth rate of some economic indicators in July has indeed fallen back.
Because the domestic and international economy is still in the process of deep adjustment in July, the international situation is complex and changeable, and the recovery of the world economy is less than expected, so the export pressure is still relatively large.
Judging from the domestic situation, the entire economy is still in the critical stage of adjustment, the pain of adjustment is released, and the economy is facing no small downward pressure, so some indicators are fluctuating.
Sheng Laiyun pointed out that there is also a special situation in July, the floods are more serious, and the hot and hot weather has brought some impact on the production and operation in some areas.
According to the situation recently released by the Ministry of Civil Affairs, more than 60 million people across the country have been affected, with direct economic losses of more than 200 billion yuan.
From the perspective of indicators related to industry, investment and transportation, these areas are affected to varying degrees.
In July, the growth rate of cargo weekly transfers fell by 3.6 percentage points compared with the previous month, and the floods had a certain impact on traffic in these areas.
Judging from these factors, the fluctuations in some indicators in July are also very normal, and they are also expected.
He said that "the situation is still good" means that although the economic growth rate has declined, the overall economic operation is stable, and the general trend of steady progress and steady improvement has not changed.
In July, the CPI rose by 1.8%, up 0.2% month-on-month; from January to July, the CPI rose by 2.1%, so the price situation was generally stable.
According to the statistics of the portal network of the Chongqing Meteorological Bureau on the high-temperature weather of various districts and counties, in addition to Yanyang, the rest of the city can receive different degrees of high temperature allowance.
At present, at least 28 provinces in the country have clarified the criteria for payment of allowances, but the standards issued by provinces and cities are not the same, and Chongqing receives high temperature allowances according to high-temperature workday allowances.
Below 37 °C above 35°C, it should be issued according to the standard of not less than 10 yuan per person per day; at more than 37 °C, it should be issued according to the standard of not less than 15 yuan per person per day.
High-temperature workers above 40 °C can receive up to 20 yuan / day allowance per month (except for workers who have already enjoyed high-temperature job allowances in accordance with the law).
According to this standard, Kaizhou, which has the highest number of days of high-temperature weather last month, can receive 330 yuan, and the city port with the lowest number of days is 80 yuan, and the highest temperature in Yuyang has not reached the high temperature standard, so there is no high temperature allowance.
In the past, many units will offset the high temperature allowance with cool drinks, and the Municipal Safety Supervision Bureau said that this behavior is not in line with the current approach.
Due to the high temperature to stop working, shorten the working hours, the employer shall not deduct or reduce the wages of workers.
The Municipal Human Resources and Social Security Bureau said that if an employee encounters a high-temperature operation but does not receive a high-temperature allowance, they can fight for their legitimate rights and interests through the labor dispute mediation agency in which the enterprise is located, or call 12333 for complaints.
If the employer refuses to pay the high temperature allowance, the worker may complain to the competent department of human resources and social security at or above the county level where the employment is located.
At the same time, since the high temperature allowance is part of the salary, not the benefit, it should be included in the total amount of the salary and the deduction of individual taxes.
Therefore, the high temperature allowance is not within the scope of the minimum wage and must be paid in the form of cash and cannot be substituted in kind such as beverages.
The newly built Urumqi Station is located in the high-speed railway area of Urumqi City, with an entire construction area of about 100,000 square meters.
The first and second floors on the ground are pit stops, waiting halls, offices, and commercial rooms, and the first basement floor is the outbound layer.
At present, Urumqi Station is the largest integrated transportation hub in Xinjiang, integrating high-speed rail, rail transit, public transportation, rental, etc., which can realize the seamless docking of various transfer methods.
There are three ticket halls on the north and south sides of the platform layer and on the north side of the exit layer, equipped with 39 artificial ticket windows and 34 vending machines.
In terms of checking tickets, there are a total of 30 channels on the east and west sides of the waiting hall, and passengers can carry out rapid inspection and waiting according to the ticket number on the ticket.
If you need help, you can select the 41 call buttons set up in the nearby press station, and you can get timely service.
From July 1st, the passenger train from the old passenger station, that is, Urumqi South Station, will travel to Urumqi Station step by step.
That is to say, all trains and 30 pairs of trains can be stopped at Urumqi Station.
At present, both stations can buy tickets for the ride, and the train travel time between them is about 10 minutes, and passengers need to pay attention to pay attention to the origin of the ticket and the specific name of the terminal.
The official operation of Urumqi's new passenger station will become an important platform for Xinjiang to build a national comprehensive transportation city and promote the construction of the "Silk Road Economic Belt" and new areas.
Gracia is a budding female toucan, covered in the atmosphere of the rainforest.
In the Central American country of Costa Rica, the toucan Gracia and its story have long been well-known.
At a press conference on August 10, Gracia, who recovered after surgery, was finally unveiled, showing people its new 3D printed plastic bird beak.
This toucan, which had been broken a year and a half ago, has finally regained its new life.
This day not only announced that it has returned to 100% health, but it is also the day that it has moved into the luxurious aviary to meet human friends who care about it.
Gracia, who first entered the new home, was slightly shy, but often became lively, frolicking in the basin and eating grapes with new beaks.
In order to remind people of the damage it once suffered, the technician did not color its new beak, but kept the original white of the 3D printing material.
The outside of the beak is a thin horny sheath, which is hollow inside, with only a few fine bone support rods interleaving.
Although there is this internal reinforcement component, the beak of the toucan is still fragile, and it is broken when it is harmed.
The Animal Rescue Center, ornithologists, and an American 3D printing company worked together to create several “experimented beaks” for Gracia, which finally created the “perfect beak” that best suited it.
Gracia is now proficient in drinking water, eating, and even pecking tiny grains.
“It took about two months for the design of the finished product, and it took only four or five hours to print.”
"3D printing is not the technology of the future, it has really entered your life," Thomas Lange, chairman of SG3D printing in the United States, said in an interview with Xinhua International.
In January 2015, on a farm in Gracia, the province of Alajuela in central Costa Rica, a blood-stained toucan, Gracia, was found.
At that time, its beak was cruelly broken by a group of young people, it was completely unable to eat, and his life was in danger.
Gracia's tragedy, after being reported in the media, caused a wave of opposition to animal cruelty inside and outside Costa Rica.
There are calls for stricter animal protection laws and increased penalties for abusers.
People came spontaneously to do their best to help Gracia recover as much as possible from life before she was injured.
Even the inventor of 3D printing technology, Chuck Hull, was involved in the design of Graceia’s beak.
“Gracia's situation is very special, and the remaining part of its beak is less than 1 centimeter, so it poses many difficulties in installing the new beak.”
“Let’s scan Gracia first, and then we’ll design and make an extended prosthesis that’s slightly longer than the rest of its beak, fixed to its upper beak with viscose.”
“This can reduce further intrusive damage to Gracia,” Lange told Xinhua International.
Before installing the prosthesis, the staff had to clear the beak for Gracia every day to prevent the infection.
Thousands of miles away, the story of the toucan, Graceia, touched the famous documentary filmmaker Paula Heredia and Discovery News Channel producer John Hoffman.
They recorded bits and pieces of Gracea’s installation of the new beak, and recorded a documentary, “The Country of Toucans,” which aired on the Animal Planet Channel this month.
The documentary “The Country of Toucans” shows how a small toucan is how to make a country change and how citizens can participate in the fight against animal cruelty.
In particular, Japanese oil companies are wary of the rise of China's small independent refineries, known as "teapots."
Japan's largest oil company, JX Energy, believes that "China's export expansion is one of the reasons for the downturn."
In particular, Japanese oil companies are wary of the rise of China's small independent refineries, known as "teapots."
The quality of China's petroleum products is gradually approaching Japan's oil products due to the Chinese government's strengthened environmental protection regulations.
Before obtaining the crude oil import license, the "teapot refinery" generally imported heavy oil with high sulfur content from Russia and other places for refining.
The production of petroleum products with high sulfur content and poor oil products has become one of the causes of environmental pollution.
After obtaining the crude oil import license, the "teapot refinery" was able to import Omanan crude oil with low sulfur content and Russian crude oil, and the quality of its petroleum products also increased.
"As China's domestic petroleum product quality standards continue to improve, the ability of refining equipment has also increased."
As a result, the quality of petroleum products exported by China has gradually reached the same level as (the world's highest quality) Japan."
JX Energy said: "After the end of 2015, China began to export high-quality light oil to Australia", competing with Japanese products in the Asian market.
Although "Japan's high oil" is facing a crisis, the response strategy adopted by Japanese oil companies is only to "pay attention to the market while exporting to profitable regions."
Due to the huge impact of China's exports of petroleum products on the Asian market, the focus on teapot refineries is also increasing.
In 2016, the Yangtze Evening News Sunshine Student Aid Initiative was launched on May 26, and after two months of registration, the total number of poor students applying for grants reached more than 800.
In the course of the study, it has received more than 1.2 million yuan of social donations (publicized in five batches), which can help at least 240 cold students.
At present, donations are continuing, and this newspaper calls on the society to continue to reach out for help, so that more children with family difficulties can receive financial support and social care.
In order to ensure the fairness, openness and transparency of the student's actions, this newspaper announced the basic information of the students in batches from today, and announced the first to the 100th today, and accepted the supervision of readers.
Liqun's sunshine assistance action is China's well-known philanthropic brand, and the Yangtze Evening Liqun sunshine student action has been carried out in Jiangsu since 2003, supporting more than 4,000 poor students.
The scope of funding for this activity is the college entrance examination undergraduate admission of new students, excluding tuition-free majors; quality and excellence, family poverty.
New Zealand’s population growth was previously more than 2 per cent at the peak of the “baby boomers” in 1974 and early 1960s.
As of June this year, New Zealand's net inflow of immigrants in 12 months was 69,100, making it the main driver of New Zealand's population growth in recent years.
In addition, at the same time, New Zealand's population grew naturally by 28,200 people.
According to statistics, in the past 10 years, New Zealand's average annual net inflow of immigrants was 21,800 people, and the average annual population growth was 32,300.
In terms of demographics, the influx of immigrants means that the proportion of the “working-age population” between the ages of 15 and 39 has gradually expanded.
In the 12 months to June 2016, New Zealand’s working-age population grew by 3.6 per cent to 1.58 million.
At the same time, the elderly population over the age of 65 also increased by 3.6 per cent, reaching 700,000.
At about 10 a.m. yesterday, X9003 international freight trains drove out of Xi'an's Xi'an new station to Almaty, Kazakhstan.
The operation of the train marks that the Xi'an Railway Bureau has successfully exceeded 10,000 vehicles since it opened the Central Asian international freight train in 2013.
It is understood that this freight train transports six major categories of industrial raw materials, machinery and equipment, industrial spare parts, building materials, food, light industrial products, a total of 206 varieties.
As of August 11 this year, the new station opened a total of 221 trains and 10009 vehicles in Central Asia, with a total of 338,000 tons of exported goods, of which 84 were opened in 2016, an increase of 47% year-on-year.
It is understood that the first cargo carried by the Central Asian train is "made in Shaanxi", and today, it has attracted a large number of foreign sources.
As of the end of July, the number of trains in Central Asia exceeded 64,000 TEU, an increase of 8% compared with the same period in 2015.
With the opening of the Central Asian train, the freight volume of Xi'an Railway Bureau's newly built station has increased year by year.
In 2015, the annual freight throughput of the new station was 2.477 million tons, and as of August 10, 2016, the freight delivery volume had reached 1.531 million tons, an increase of 6.7% over the same period last year.
In order to meet the needs of future development, Xi'an Railway Bureau's plan for the construction of Xi'an's new railway integrated logistics center, centered on new stations, has been introduced, making every effort to build a modern new railway integrated logistics park.
An Indian uncle who had just experienced an aircraft landing at the Dubai International Airport last week won a $1 million jackpot at the same airport this week.
Mohammed al-Bashir Abdul Khdal, an Indian who has long lived in Dubai in the United Arab Emirates, has the habit of buying lottery tickets every time he returns home.
His 21-year-old son was paralyzed by an unexpected fall when he was 13 days old, and he’s been working hard to pay off his son’s medical care loans.
“Escaping from an air crash is when God gave me two lifetimes and gave me the money for me to do good,” Hedal said.
Although it is now autumn, the power of the "autumn tiger" does not seem to be worse than that in summer.
Ultraviolet rays not only make the student's skin turn black, but also sunburn the skin, how to make the skin pass through military training smoothly and not be sunburned?
Sunscreen packaging is generally marked with SPF and PA, SPF refers to the sun protection index, for UVB ultraviolet rays, our common SPF index has 15, 30, 50 and so on.
The products marked with PA are for UVA, so that sun protection products will play a more effective role, under normal circumstances, the strength of PA is represented by +, and more than one + indicates that the effective protection time is extended.
Oily skin should choose more permeable water-based sun protection products, sunscreen spray is also a good choice.
Dry skin should choose frost-like sunscreen products; neutral skin generally has no strict regulations, sensitive skin wipes any maintenance products are a burden, it is recommended to choose purely physical sunscreen products.
Remember to apply sunscreen half an hour in advance, as it will take time for sunscreen products to fully penetrate into the skin.
Military training sunshine time is longer, sunscreen every two hours to wipe once to have a long-lasting effect, do not be lazy.
Because the skin has just been irritated by the sun, the military training does not come back immediately with whitening products.
After the military training exposure, if you have the conditions, you can use a towel wrapped in an iced ice to burn the skin to slow down the local dry heat.
Farmers who purchase agricultural machinery during the exhibition will continue to implement the cumulative subsidy policy, and farmers can get up to 40% of the subsidies for purchasing agricultural machinery.
The exhibition is aimed at the global investment exhibition, especially to increase the invitation to the countries along the "Belt and Road" and the target market countries.
This exhibition strives to complete 60 investment contract projects, introduce 22 billion yuan of funds, sign more than 160 trade contracts, with a contract amount of 3.2 billion yuan.
It is reported that the "Xiangbo Expo" for seven consecutive years, due to the strong manufacturing industry base in Loudi City, Hunan Province, the history of industrial development for a long time.
As the host of the "Xiang Expo", Loudi has established trade relations with more than 90 countries around the world.
"Xiangbo" has become an important platform for the local cultivation of characteristic industrial development and the promotion of characteristic industries out of the country.
On some nights, the ionosphere is filled with free electrons, which means radio signals can go further.
According to the U.S. "Popular Science" monthly website reported on August 11, the U.S. Air Force is interested in copying this effect.
While having a stable, large number of free-to-electronic ionospheric layers can help people listen to it at the edge of the reach of a university radio station, this may not be an interest for the U.S. Air Force.
The electron-filled ionosphere means that the radio used by the military has a greater range of broadcasts, and it may provide some protection against solar storms for Global Positioning System (GPS) signals.
The ultimate goal may be to create a series of CubeSats based on demand, which can strengthen the ionosphere when needed.
But first, these teams, which have signed contracts with the Air Force, must prove that the scientific principles will work.
According to industry data, the total scale of coal production capacity in 2015 was close to 6 billion tons, and the country's coal overcapacity was 1.8 billion tons.
In the past ten years, the State Council has issued a total of five notifications on the elimination of excess and backward production capacity.
Although the first four times were not aimed at the coal industry, the target industry is directly related to the coal industry.
From November last year to January this year, Qinhuangdao 5,500 kcal thermal coal prices have been hovering at a low of 370 yuan / ton for a long time, and 90% of coal companies have fallen into losses.
Since February, coal prices have gradually rebounded, and Qinhuangdao thermal coal prices have recently risen for four consecutive weeks, rising to a high of 16 months, once climbing to 436 yuan per ton, up nearly 70 yuan from the beginning of the year.
With the recovery of prices, all walks of life are worried: will a number of small coal mines return to work and resume production?
In this regard, China (Hainan) Reform and Development Research Institute of economic director Qian Xianming conducted an analysis and interpretation.
Qian Xianming: the production capacity has aroused great concern from all parties, and the transcript of the coal industry's production capacity released today has indeed made everyone more worried.
These three surface factors still reflect the reason for the relative lag in the transformation of our growth mode in the past, that is, the government-led growth mode has not yet received a fundamental change.
Second, this is also directly related to the promotion of local governments, in the process of going to production capacity, funds and corresponding supporting measures should be in place, from this point of view, the differences between different regions are indeed relatively large.
Third, if some provinces with relatively slow progress are going to catch up in the second half of the year, they may face greater risks.
In this case, relying on the central bonus funds to promote the process of de-capacity may have a certain negative impact.
First of all, to the production capacity is not a simple total control.
Our goal is to restructure the new format of the entire coal industry through the elimination of backward production capacity, the promotion of structural optimization.
In the process of deploying production capacity, local governments must combine the transformation and upgrading of production capacity and the coal industry, and vigorously develop related service industries.
Second, if we want to complete this year's de-production tasks this year, we still need to give full play to the strength of administrative supervision and administrative supervision.
Finally, we need to strengthen the role of social security.
Because the market is directly related to the issue of employment, we need to strengthen employment skills training for employees and employees.
“The reason for the decline in the ranking is the deterioration of foreign investment's expectations for Brazil's GDP development in the medium term."
In 2015, Brazil’s participation in global direct investment was 3.7%, down from 5.7 percent in 2014.
Credit Suisse’s International Investment Attractiveness Index includes four sub-indexes: infrastructure, economic prospects, the business environment, and the volume of direct investments.
In 2015, Brazil’s international direct investment was $64.6 billion, down from $73.1 billion in 2014.
Last year, Brazil’s “greenfield investment” (the investment model for foreign investment in factories) was $17.9 billion, down 2.1% year-on-year.
“There are 288 ‘greenfield investments’ projects in Brazil, compared to an average of 314 per year from 2003 to 2014.”
However, in the first half of 2016, international direct investment in Brazil reached $33.8 billion, an increase of almost 10% compared to the same period last year.
Original title: Canadian police killed IS supporters: homemade bomb attacks near the end
The taxi company said the taxi had been dispatched to Dreever’s home before police arrived.
Canadian police said at a news conference on Wednesday that they had received information from the U.S. Federal Bureau of Investigation (FBI) about a "marty video" about the young man who was about to carry out the attack.
According to DW, a man wearing a black balaka hat is reading the Qur’an, referring to crimes against Muslims, and vowing to launch an attack on a city in Canada soon.
He said in the video that the attack will take place within 72 hours, and it will be during peak hours.
This is the first time since Canadian Prime Minister Justin Trudeau came to power last year that police killed a terrorist suspect before the incident.
After the upgrading and renovation of the Beijing-Hangzhou Grand Canal branch channel of the old Wanfu River, the north of the channel since September 1st to collect tolls.
These two tributary waterways adopt social financing methods for renovation and construction, and the fees have been approved by the relevant departments of the provincial government.
The old Wanfu River channel flows through Jinxiang and Fishtai, and enters the main channel of the Beijing-Hangzhou Grand Canal through Nanyang Lake, with a total length of 32.5 kilometers.
According to the needs of navigation, the old Wanfu River channel adopts the method of maintenance and transformation, the local water depth is deep, the local sharp bend is cut straight, and the navigation conditions can be improved.
The channel flows through Jinxiang County and Rencheng District, and enters the main channel of the Beijing-Hangzhou Grand Canal through Nanyang Lake, with a total length of 19 kilometers.
The renovation project of the two waterways started construction in February 2011, completed the acceptance in January 2015, and the investment and construction and operation of the main body was Jining Anping Canal Logistics Service Center.
In accordance with the principle of "loan construction and fee repayment", Jining Anping Canal Logistics Service Center levies channel tolls in accordance with the charging standards approved by the Price Bureau of Shandong Province.
Among them, the basic toll is calculated according to 1.75 yuan / load ton, and the mileage toll is calculated according to 0.05 yuan / km load ton.
The toll collection period is from June 15, 2016 to June 14, 2019.
The reporter learned from the Jining Port and Navigation Bureau that there are currently four toll shipping lanes in Jining, namely, the waterway of the Shui River, the Baima River channel, the channel of the North Sleepe, and the old Wanfu River channel.
The four waterways are tributaries of the Beijing-Hangzhou Grand Canal, all of which have been upgraded by means of social financing.
The Shushui River channel upgrading project is the first to adopt the "government + market" model, which is used for the construction of inland port and shipping infrastructure projects in Shandong Province, the government accounts for the main investment, and the social funds supplement the funding gap.
Branch waterways such as the Baima River, the Old Wanfu River, and the Beidali River have adopted a purely market-oriented way of operation.
The funds allocated by the state's finances cannot meet the needs of the construction of the project and restrict the progress of the upgrading of waterways.
The use of social funds for the construction of public infrastructure meets the requirements of national policies, and has also become a way to crack the bottleneck of funds.
Ning Zetao's performance in the 100-meter freestyle semi-finals has silenced many Chinese spectators.
However, in the 50-meter freestyle preliminaries, Ning Zetao once again refreshed people's "bottom line".
In fact, the 50-meter freestyle is not Ning Zetao's main event, and his performance and best results at the Kazan World Championships have also determined that he is unlikely to achieve a breakthrough in this project.
Sure enough, Hong Kong's authoritative media "Grand Gazette" revealed that the biggest reason for Ning Zetao's loss is that he has lost his interest in swimming.
Many of the factors off the field may have had a big impact on his ideas for the future, and he may now be more interested in entering the entertainment industry.
After the Kazan World Championships, Ning Zetao instantly became a net red with its high face value and good results.
As a result, "national husbands", "small fresh meat", "fantastic men" and other names have continued to become the labels on his body.
All kinds of business activities come to the door, the beautiful road of money has become a golden road.
In this case, Ning Zetao, even if he chooses to retire at this time to join the entertainment industry, is not only his freedom, but also a seemingly feasible path.
After all, he is only 23 years old, and after a certain degree of study, he can star in one or two TV series with his popularity.
However, Ning Zetao needs to see if he has enough qualifications compared with these predecessors?
At the 2000 Sydney Olympics, 21-year-old Liu Xuan has reached the end of an athlete's career.
Liu's appearance allows her to be quickly remembered by people, but also laid the foundation for her to enter the entertainment industry in the future.
After retiring, Liu Xun starred in a number of TV series and set up his own studio in 2013.
Tian Liang participated in the single-double ten-meter stage competition of the two Olympic Games, and won 2 gold and 2 silver.
However, after losing to team-mate Hu Jia in the single ten-meter competition of the 2004 Olympic Games, Tian Liang's competitive status declined, and he was expelled by the diving team.
And he and his daughter participated in variety shows such as "Where's Daddy", which allowed him to make eyeballs.
Yang Wei, Li Xiaopeng and Chen Yiping, the former golden generation of gymnastics, participated in various variety shows.
It is worth mentioning that Yang Wei Li Xiaopeng led China to win the 2008 Olympic men's team championship at that time, and Yang Wei won the individual all-around gold medal twice, known as the all-around king.
At the same time that Chen Yibing led China to win the 2012 Olympic team championship, he also became the king of hanging rings.
After suffering a misjudgment of losing the gold medal at the London Olympics, Chen Yibing's big move also allowed him to circle countless powders.
However, the main energy of these athletes at present is still in the arena, and the variety show is only like a piece of dragonfly - touch and walk.
However, whether it is retired or active athletes, it is necessary to get the favor of the entertainment industry.
After all, athletes enter a new field, whether it is ability or network, is a blank state.
Even Tian Liang and Liu Xuan, the "old people" who have been mixed in the entertainment circle for many years, the general audience mentions them, and they still think more about their performance in the Olympic Games.
Yang Wei, Li Xiaopeng and other newcomers, introduced when they appeared on the variety show, without exception, were "Olympic champions".
Compared with the above few people, Ning Zetao's name of a swimming world champion is still slightly thin.
What's more, compared to Tian Liang, Liu Xuan, Yang Wei and others who have retreated, Ning Zetao's 23-year-old sports career has suffered setbacks, and the negative impact on its image is probably immeasurable.
After all, when it comes to athletes, people's demands are "not asking for hundreds of wins, but don't be afraid of difficulties", Ning Zetao is still far away from this.
Ten thousand steps back said that Ning Zetao is handsome and can rely on the support of thousands of brain powder.
There is no bit of power, only rely on the appearance, want to mix well in the entertainment industry, this is not more difficult than good training to find the state it should.
The choice of the road of life is all based on personal wishes, but in the end of how to choose, Ning Zetao should have numbers in his heart.
On the surface, online social platforms have expanded their communicative circles and reduced people’s loneliness.
The sphere of influence of online socialization has become more and more extensive, not only gradually replacing the traditional telephone contact, and even infiltrating into the offline real life circle, quietly changing the social life of the current people.
The benefits of online socialization are obvious, such as being convenient and quick, so they are particularly favored by young people.
According to a survey on the social habits of college students, 57% of college students spend more than 5 hours a day using their mobile phones, and their daily life is basically "not leaving their hands."
"Social networking has the characteristics of low cost, fast transmission speed, and simultaneous communication between many people, which meets the needs of contemporary college students."
Expanding the circle of interpersonal relationships, more equal conversations, and avoiding social concerns are the main reasons why we are more and more loved to talk online.
Newcomers who have just entered the company love to communicate with their colleagues online, "because they are not very familiar with the unit, and through the likes and comments of the social platform, the relationship is much closer than before."
"Precedintly with friends because of some misunderstandings for some time did not contact, and then in a large group of first a few words to warm up."
IT engineer Wu Yan is a deep network social enthusiast, and most of his social life occurs online, and the number of online contacts is several times higher than the number of the offline circle of friends.
Wu also admitted that on the Internet, it is more “like a fish getting water”.
“You can reply to your friends when you are willing, because there is a lot of time to consider the words, and the expression can be clearer.”
“Hiding under the ID, you come and go to avoid face-to-face interpersonal collisions, not only has room for manoeuvre, but even give each other more time and space to think about words and deeds.”
“People of different identities have the right and efficiency to speak, and all kinds of social concerns in real life seem to be eliminated in cyberspace.”
However, Xiao Peng, a friend of Wu's words, felt that Wu Yan in his life was an "uninteresting house man."
