Lingshui police have now intervened in the investigation, Lingshui transportation department will also increase efforts to rectify illegal operating vehicles.
“There was no investigation into the clashes on 4 August, and on 11 August, two of the driver’s taxis were smashed again at their homes.”
“Today's tricycles are mostly operating illegally at night, and it is hoped that the competent authorities will also step up their efforts to carry out rectification."
The reporter of Nanhai Network learned from the Public Security Bureau of Lingshui Li Autonomous County that the police have now accepted the reports of these two cases, and the causes of the two cases, who committed them, and whether they are related are all under further investigation.
Wang Wenyi, director of the traffic management station of Lingshui Transport Bureau, said that at the beginning of this year, Lingshui Traffic Department began to rectify the illegal operation of passenger tricycles, and banned a total of 613 illegally operated passenger tricycles.
In the next step, the transportation department will apply to the county government and work with multiple departments to strengthen the rectification of illegal operating vehicles such as tricycles, motorcycles and black cars in the county.
At 8 a.m. on August 11, Qilu Evening News reporters followed the "Healthy China Tour" clinic service team to Hegou Village, Xihu Town, Donggang District.
The village is remote, about 24 kilometers from the urban area, more than 200 residents in the village, due to economic, transportation and physical limitations, to many middle-aged and elderly patients to go out to see a doctor inconvenience.
The project is relatively comprehensive, internal medicine, surgery, respiratory, psychiatry, dermatology, pediatrics.
Many of the villagers heard that the experts of the clinic were about to come and were already waiting in the small square of the village.
The 67-year-old is suffering from congenital scoliosis, and in recent years, she has been deeply troubled by "asthma", so that even walking on the last slope will be breathless and breathless.
The doctor told Mrs. Xue that it is unlikely that chronic bronchitis wants a fundamental cure, and it is common to insist that medication can be alleviated.
At the dermatologist's consultation office, an elderly man in his 60s came to consult with his grandson.
The old man's grandson is 11 years old, and from the age of 3, his left foot has always been plagued by "foot gas".
The doctor told the elderly after checking that this is not "foot gas" but seasonal eczema, do not arbitrarily delay the treatment with drugs.
"In this village, we provide medical treatment and B super services, while another team in Wulian County, Qiujiadian Village, also provides free medical examination services.
This rural clinic is only one part of the "Healthy China Tour", and other activities will be carried out one after another in the coming days."
51Talk English is considered to be a milestone in building an online education industry ecosystem.
Huang Jiajia, CEO, said that bringing the world's best learning resources to the children in China is their strategy for the next five years.
It is understood that the biggest advantage of 51Talk is to meet the needs of users of different ages.
Chief Operating Officer Zhang Liming said that the world's high-quality foreign teachers and services are connected with the student side, and parents no longer use boats and cars, and use valuable time to pick up their children.
The central bank renewed the payment business licenses of 27 non-bank institutions such as Alipay for 5 years.
In order to integrate business resources, give play to scale effects, and improve regulatory efficiency, this renewal adjusts the scope of its business to the payment institutions that are fitted and "payment business licenses".
The merged payment institution shall, within 6 months from the date of the announcement, complete the payment business undertaking work.
The People's Bank of China will, after the completion of the business undertaking work, handle the cancellation and renewal of the relevant payment business license.
Due to the existence of serious business violations by some payment institutions, business stagnation, or active applications to terminate business types, this renewal reduces its business scope.
The relevant agencies shall, within 6 months from the date of the announcement, stop carrying out the relevant payment business in an orderly manner as required.
The People's Bank of China will continue to carry out the renewal work of "Payment Business License" in accordance with the law.
