Recently, the 10th China International Folk Art Festival hosted by the Chinese Literature Federation and the Qinghai Provincial Government kicked off in Xining, Qinghai.
More than 300 artists from 13 countries and regions on five continents gathered together, bringing the audience with wonderful performances with international and national folk characteristics.
Tajikistan's "Avesta" news agency on the 11th quoted the central bank as saying that in the first seven months of this year, Tajikistan's inflation rate was 3.7%.
In the first seven months of this year, the inflation rate in Tasmania was 3.7%, of which inflation was 0.6% in July, compared with 6% in the past year.
According to the report, the government aims to control the annual inflation rate in 2016 at 7.5%, compared with 5.1% in 2015.
In addition, the report also pointed out that there are some differences between the government and the forecasts of some major international financial institutions on the economic development and inflation in 2016.
According to the forecast of the Ministry of Trade and Economic Development, the economic growth of the country will reach 7% in 2016, and the country's inflation is basically above this level.
The Asian Development Bank, the World Bank and the International Monetary Fund have given different forecasts for the country's economic development and inflation in 2016.
For these two indicators, the Asian Development Bank's forecast is 4.2% and 7%, the World Bank's forecast is 4.8% and 7.5%, and the International Monetary Fund's forecast is 3.4% and 8.2%.
It is reported that despite a series of unfavorable external factors such as the international economic downturn, the depreciation of the Russian ruble and the reduction of remittances, the economy of Tasmania achieved 6% growth in 2015.
On August 11, when the reporter's telephone interview had returned to Huang Yilin of Mianyang's home in Sichuan, she said: "At that time, the situation was too urgent, I had only one idea in my heart is to save people!"
Huang Yilin is a 2015-level student at the Scenic Garden College of Central and Southern Forestry University.
Huang Yilin, who studied urban and rural planning, wanted to visit and study local architectural design in Zhenzhong, Sichuan, so the family went to travel.
At about 10 a.m. on August 8, Huang Yilin's father rested in the hotel, and the mother and daughter came out to visit the ancient city.
It wasn’t very long when I suddenly saw a group of people shouting and coming forward out of curiosity.
Seeing that "the little boy has disappeared, the little girl is desperate in the water, only her little head is exposed on the river, and from time to time she sinks", Huang Yilin, who learned to swim as a child, quickly jumped down to save people.
After going into the water, Huang Yilin, who was 165 cm tall, found that she couldn't step into the end!
It used to look calm on the surface of the water, but it was a torrent below!
However, she swam to the little girl in spite of everything.
Huang Yilin said that the river is turbid and rapid, less than 5 meters away, almost all her strength.
She did her best to push the little girl to the edge of the embankment: "The slope is particularly slippery, and I'm afraid I won't have the strength to sink."
As a result, Huang Yilin asked his mother for help, heard her daughter's call for help, and Ms. Yin, who had a bad water, was ready to go into the water for rescue and was stopped by the tourists next to him.
On August 10th, after Huang Yilin jumped to save people, Ms. Yin received the condolences and praise of many relatives and friends at the same time, but also many relatives and friends "accountability."
To be honest, when the child couldn't stand on the embankment and asked me for help, my heart was about to break."
Ms. Yin said that although it is very dangerous, if she is in such a scene again, she will still support her daughter's choice, and she is proud of her daughter!
Because it was forced, Huang Yilin rarely took the initiative after learning to swim, "I didn't expect this skill to really come in handy."
According to Chen Yifan, the class leader of Huang Yilin's class, Huang Yilin is recognized as a "student leader" in the class, and he is helpful.
The opening ceremony of the first Youth Games in Yunnan Province opened on the 13th to play the national card to show the vitality of youth.
The first youth games in Yunnan Province will be held from August 13 to August 22 in Mang City, Dehong Prefecture.
On August 12, the organizing committee held a press conference to introduce the organization of the competition and the preparations for the opening ceremony.
The first Youth Games in Yunnan Province were hosted by the Yunnan Provincial Sports Bureau and hosted by the People's Government of Mang City, and the opening ceremony will be held on the morning of the 13th.
There are 11 events such as track and field, football, basketball, tennis, volleyball, weightlifting, cycling, wrestling, gymnastics, and martial arts, involving 180 minor competitions.
Chang Lin, deputy director of the organizing committee of the first Youth Games in Yunnan Province and deputy director of the Provincial Sports Bureau, introduced that around the principle of "government-led, market operation, and frugality", at present, all preparations have been put in place.
The renovation work of the Dehong Old Sports Association Weightlifting Hall and the Martial Arts Hall, the small wrestling hall in Mang City, and the mountain biking track in Yinta Scenic Area have been completed.
In terms of event security, the conference currently recruits 580 volunteers, and during the competition, these volunteers will serve athletes and spectators in various arenas.
At the same time, 70 medical personnel and 11 ambulances were transferred from the hospitals of Dehong Prefecture to form 11 medical teams, which were responsible for the medical protection of the competition site and the accommodation of the athletes.
Involving the opening and closing ceremonies, the ignition ceremony of this year's Youth Games combines the characteristics of the traditional movement of ethnic minorities in Yunnan, which will show the rich connotation of Yunnan culture.
At present, in order to prepare for the opening ceremony of literary performances, a total of 1,500 student actors and other professional actors of Dehong Vocational College have been transferred to more than 2,000 people.
The opening and closing ceremony will be fully integrated into the Yunnan elements, with the characteristics of Dehong, showing the characteristics of the regional culture and folk customs of Mang City in Dehongzhou.
At present, the rehearsal of the opening ceremony is over, and an official performance will be held tomorrow morning.
The opening performance of this year's Youth Games is larger than in the past.
From September 1st, people between the ages of 60 and 64 will be able to take buses in urban areas at half price.
On the morning of the 11th, Jining bus company IC card sales center, several elderly people in front of the card window are queuing up to run the card, 62-year-old Master Yao got the senior half-price card.
Previously, the Jining Municipal Aging Committee, the Municipal Finance Bureau, and the Municipal Transportation Bureau issued the "Notice on Half-Price of Urban Buses for 60-64 Seniors", and the preferential policy was officially implemented from September 1 this year.
"Eligible elderly people, holding a second-generation ID card to the IC sales center can apply; foreign accounts meet the age of the elderly also enjoy this benefit."
Liu Xia, deputy director of the computer center of Jining Bus Company, said that since August 1st, more than 200 elderly half-price cards have been held.
At present, the old card is divided into two types, one is the old free card, and the other is the old half price card.
“In order to facilitate the elderly, the system has been upgraded, and the free card for the elderly has been reduced from the original trial twice a year to once, and the elderly holding the card do not have to run twice.”
According to the official Weibo news of the SFC, the CSRC said today that at present, close cooperation between the securities regulatory authorities of the two places, as well as between the Shenzhen Stock Exchange and the Hong Kong Stock Exchange.
At the same time, the SFC set up a special working group on "Shenzhen-Hong Kong Connect" to actively promote the preparations for the "Shenzhen-Hong Kong Connect", and after the relevant regulatory rules and technical equipment are ready, this year will be opened.
Group fraud text messages reached a certain number, even if there is no fraud, you can also defraude crime.
The People's Court of Wolong District, Nanyang City, Henan Province, found that from September 30 to October 4, 2015, the defendant Li Huiwang successively sent fraud information using pseudo base station equipment in Tongbai County and Nanyang City.
In the same year, at about 10 o'clock on October 5, the defendant was arrested by the public security police when he once again came to a hotel room in Wolong District of Nanyang City to send fraudulent text messages using fake base stations.
After evaluation, the pseudo base station equipment sent 62,228 text messages on October 4, 2015, resulting in the communication of 62,228 mobile phone users per capita interrupted communication for more than 8 seconds to less than 10 minutes.
After trial, the court held that the defendant Li Weiwang used the pseudo base station to send a total of 62,228 fraudulent text messages to unspecified majorities, and his behavior has constituted the crime of fraud.
It is recommended to adopt the opinion that the defendant was arrested when the defendant was arrested is an attempted offender and did not cause consequences, and the attitude of confession is better, and it is recommended to adopt the opinion that it should be punished lightly.
Combined with the nature of the defendant's crime and the attitude of confessing guilt, he was sentenced to 4 years and 6 months in prison for fraud, and fined 10,000 yuan.
The Tohoku tiger is currently listed as an Endangered (EN) species by the International Union for the Conservation of Nature (IUCN).
According to the Forestry Department of Jilin Province, according to the joint monitoring data of China, the United States, Russia and other countries in 1998, there were only 4 to 6 wild northeast tigers in Jilin Province and 3 to 5 leopards in the northeast.
According to Yu Changchun, director of the protection department of the Forestry Department of Jilin Province, in recent years, Jilin Province has continuously increased the protection of wild animals, and the population of northeast tigers and northeast leopards in China is growing significantly, and the distribution area continues to expand.
According to the latest monitoring data in 2015, 27 wild Northeast tigers and 42 northeastern leopards have been detected in Jilin Province alone.
As the world's flagship species of wildlife protection distributed in the China-Russia border region, the cooperation between China and Russia is of great significance for the recovery and reproduction of the population of tigers and leopards in the wild.
According to the Forestry Department of Jilin Province, Jilin Province has established a long-term and stable cooperation and exchange mechanism with Russia.
At the 2016 International Forum on the Protection of China's Haochun Tiger and leopard, the forestry departments and animal protection organizations of China and Russia once again reached a number of consensuses.
Jilin Provincial Forestry Department said that strengthening cooperation in the protection of tigers and leopards between China and Russia is not only a very urgent task facing the protection of tigers and leopards in Northeast China, but also a top priority to maintain the health of Russian tigers and leopard populations.
As a leading cadre of party members, Sun Fujian's ideals and beliefs have been lost, serious violations of party discipline, and after the 18th National Congress of the Party, they still do not converge, they do not close their hands, they violate discipline, and their nature is bad and the circumstances are serious.
After this case occurred, after a number of media reports, it became the focus of the case, and the social impact was extremely bad.
After the incident, the leaders of the Criminal Police Detachment of Haikou Public Security Bureau attached great importance to it, and immediately organized a team of competent police forces to take the initiative to launch an investigation.
The police immediately pursued the suspect online, took a variety of measures to control, and contacted the foreign police to investigate the whereabouts of a country.
Because the suspect is a repeat offender of theft, he has repeatedly been cracked down on by the public security organs, and has strong anti-reconnaissance ability, coupled with his long-term use of drugs, the interrogation of toxic addiction often occurs, and the interrogation work is very difficult.
Greenland sharks, also known as small sleeping sharks, are widely distributed in the North Atlantic waters around Greenland and Iceland, and are 4 to 5 meters long when they reach adulthood.
However, their growth rate is extremely slow, sometimes only about 1 centimeter long in a year, which indicates that Greenland sharks may have the life span of their foreign ministers.
Traditional dating methods typically use calcified tissue in animals, and some sharks can use fin ridges, but this calcified tissue is very rare among Greenland sharks.
The new study, led by Julius Nelson of the University of Copenhagen in Denmark, turned to radiocarbon dating using Greenland shark’s eye lens.
This method has previously been used to determine the age of whales, but it is the first time it has been used to determine the age of fish such as sharks.
Their analysis showed that the largest shark had an estimated lifespan of 392 years, with an error of 120 years.
That is to say, this shark is at least 272 years old, with a maximum of 512 years old.
In addition, the female's Greenland shark is said to have to be about 4 meters long to mature sexually, which means that it is at least 156 years old to reach adulthood.
As a result, the researchers wrote in the paper that Greenland sharks are the oldest known vertebrates on Earth, surpassing the previous longevity champion right whales (211 years old).
In the past year, the exchange rate has achieved remarkable results, and the RMB exchange rate has remained basically stable, which has also laid the foundation for promoting the internationalization of the RMB.
From the perspective of market performance, in the past year, the two-way fluctuating characteristics of the RMB exchange rate have been obvious, the exchange rate flexibility has been enhanced, and the exchange rate is expected to be generally stable.
So far, the fluctuation of the RMB against the middle price of the US dollar has repeatedly occurred, but the process has alternated.
Last year, the last exchange reform measures before the "8.11" exchange reform were implemented in 2005, and the RMB appreciated significantly against the US dollar in the past ten years.
Since the implementation of the new exchange rate reform, the RMB has changed its previous state of appreciation, and the middle price of the RMB exchange rate has depreciated by about 8% in one year.
On October 1 this year, the International Monetary Fund will officially accept the RMB as the weighted currency of the SDR (Special Drawing Rights).
This week, statistics released by China's General Administration of Customs showed that in the first seven months of this year, China's total import and export value was 13.21 trillion yuan, down 3% from the same period last year.
In July, China's total value of imports and exports fell by only 0.9% year-on-year, especially exports increased by 2.9% year-on-year.
Relevant experts believe that although there are signs of stabilization of imports and exports in July, there should not be excessive expectations.
In July, China's total import and export value was 2.09 trillion yuan, down 0.9% year-on-year.
Among them, exports 1.22 trillion yuan, an increase of 2.9%; imports 873 billion yuan, down 5.7%; trade surplus of 342.8 billion yuan, an increase of 34%.
Although the total value of imports and exports still declined year-on-year, there has been an increase in export data, which is also the fifth consecutive monthly increase in exports since March this year.
More than 3,400 robbers in Shanghai for 4 months cracked down on 157 "stealing and cheating" gangs
At the same time of detecting the case, the police also recovered more than 33 million yuan of stolen goods.
According to the confessions of members of the theft gang, they entered Shanghai from Shanghai by means of a black car, and then got out of the car to commit crimes, and a few hours later, they closed the car, and then left Shanghai together.
In the course of the crime, the criminal suspects often use a building as a unit, using the outer wall to climb and break the anti-theft window fence from the top to the bottom of "sweeping" theft.
A few days ago, the suspects involved in the case have been transferred by the Xuhui Public Security Bureau to the Xuhui District Procuratorate for review and prosecution.
The police reminded the general public that it is necessary to lock doors and windows at home when going out, for the choice of anti-theft windows, it is recommended that the public should choose steel with a harder material.
According to Voice of China's "News Evening Summit" report, in late August, Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe will go to Kenya to attend the 6th African Development Conference.
The African Development Conference is led by Japan, and the previous five meetings have been held in Tokyo or Yokohama in Japan, so this meeting will also be the first transfer to Africa.
In this regard, officials of Japan's Ministry of Foreign Affairs said that the local meeting in Africa has helped to attract the attention of African and European countries to Japan.
In order to cooperate with Abe's visit, according to Kyodo News Agency, Japan's Liberal Democratic Party will send a delegation of parliamentarians to relevant countries.
It’s no coincidence that Japan’s road to “entrance” began in the early 1990s, while the African Development Conference initiated by Japan also began in 1993!
Africa has 53 seats in the United Nations, which is an important voting warehouse for the United Nations, and if Japan wants to "enter the ordinary", how can it abandon Africa?
It will also exchange views with relevant people from various countries on the extremist organization "Islamic State" and countermeasures for terrorist activities.
The “Western Group” will visit seven countries, including Sierra Leone, Liberia and Guinea-Bissau.
Japan's Foreign Minister Kishida also recently explained his intentions for the African Development Conference at the United Nations Security Council.
Abe has announced that for the sake of the stability of sub-Saharan African countries, he will provide 100 billion yen (about 6.1 billion yuan) of assistance within five years.
Observers generally believe that Japan's generosity to Africa has always had two main purposes: one is to increase Japan's presence in Africa, and the other is to win the support of African countries on entry issues.
Yang Bojiang, an expert on Japan, said: "In terms of politics, although Africa is relatively lagging behind in development, the number of countries is relatively large, so Japan has always regarded it as the so-called "big ticket field".
In the future, Japan will not give up, and the work for Africa will not be terminated and will continue to be strengthened.
In terms of economy, due to Japan's relatively strong production capacity, but the domestic market is relatively limited, especially in the context of the aging of fewer children, domestic demand is relatively sluggish.
However, from Junichiro Koizumi 10 years ago, to Abe 10 years later, during this period, Japan has repeatedly launched a frequent "sprint", but they have returned.
Yang Bojiang, an expert on Japan, believes that Japan's usual intentions are obvious, but it is bound to be difficult on the road.
In order to achieve its own goals, Japan must first have good relations with neighboring countries, of which Japan needs to have a correct attitude, both in terms of geopolitical rivalries and national disputes and historical understanding.
Haikou Maritime Court opened a case in the early morning to ensure the rights and interests of the parties involved in the sinking of the fishing boat.
Relatives of the three dead crew members rushed to Haikou Maritime Court at 4 a.m. on August 7 to file an application for property preservation and seizure of suspected cargo ships.
After the incident on the 4th, the suspected freighter was detained by the Maritime Affairs Bureau in Haikou Xiuming Port to assist in the investigation.
In view of the 72-hour seizure period of the Maritime Affairs Bureau expired at 9 a.m. on August 7, the relatives of the victims filed a property preservation application with the court in the early morning of the 7th.
At 4:20 a.m., the applicant offered to save the property before the lawsuit, and the on-duty balison received patiently.
