Traditional practices introduce new highlights "2016 Yanglan Culture Festival" Hong Kong Victoria Park Opening Ceremony
The music of playing drums, traditional snacks, fancy decorations, and crowded scenes.
Hosted by the Hong Kong Association of Tide Societies, the "2016 Yilan Culture Festival" will be held in Victoria Park from 12 to 14, which is one of Hong Kong's biggest Yilan victory.
In addition to continuing the existing "stealing competition", there is also an increase in the "parent-child basin for slover competition" that the whole family can participate in.
Not only in the form of cartoons to introduce the cultural history, there is also a 3D self-portrait area, a traditional small food area, and a mobile classroom for traditional crafts, attracting many children and overseas people to experience and visit.
A couple from France spent nearly three hours at the event and experienced it in a mini-flower mobile classroom.
“I found this special festival online, so I decided to take a look at it and felt very fresh.”
They said that although France also has a festival similar to commemorating ancestors, but the atmosphere is very heavy, unlike here, there is music, there is food can also learn traditional craftsmanship.
She said: “In such a busy financial metropolis in Hong Kong, you can also see such a large-scale and organized ceremony to worship ancestors.”
"This not only reflects the diversity of Chinese culture, but also allows more people to learn about these traditional craftsmanship and pass it on."
At this event, President Hu Yansong said, “We do not want to arrange the Orchid Cultural Festival very horrifying, so that people do not dare to approach, especially children.”
"We hope that through the activities and layout of the scene, let the young people know that what they want to express is filial piety and gratitude behind the culture of the festival."
He also said that a total of 24 teams participated in the "looting competition", of which there were not only community organizations, but also cooperation with some schools to allow students to participate.
It is understood that the Hong Kong Chaoyao Lansheng Association has been included in the "National List of Intangible Cultural Heritage" in 2011.
On the evening of the 11th, China's National Peking Theatre came to Mexico City with the famous drama "White Snake" through thousands of miles, and presented an authentic Beijing opera feast for the local people at the National Palace of Fine Arts in Mexico.
As the key performance project of the "China-La Scala Cultural Exchange Year", from August 9th to 23rd, the National Peking Theatre of China performed 7 Peking operas in Mexico City, the capital of Mexico, as well as Córdoba and Juárez.
The spectators followed the "White Snake" plot of the succession, the actor's singing and playing, sometimes smiling, and sometimes warmly applauding.
Marissa Jimenez Kacho, who had watched Peking Opera 15 years ago, accompanied her daughter to the show.
“It’s a wonderful performance, music, lights, stage performances have impressed me... I think it’s very necessary for my daughter to learn more about Chinese culture and Chinese Peking Opera.”
The enthusiasm of the Mexican audience left a deep impression on the white maid's player and the young actor Fu Jia.
"I didn't expect the Mexican audience to be so enthusiastic, and I was a little worried about whether they could understand the story, but it's beyond my surprise to see that today they're going to be able to capture the storyline and a lot of laughter."
Qiu Xiaoqi, the Chinese ambassador to Mexico, said that various cultural exchange activities of this year's China-U.S.-Mexico Cultural Exchange Year have played a positive role in promoting greater understanding and friendship between the two peoples.
Next year marks the 45th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Mexico, when there will be more cultural exchange activities held between China and Mexico.
Liu Yigui went to Sanya to investigate the "double repair, two cities" and asked to improve the level of urban construction management
On the morning of the 12th, Liu Yigui presided over the symposium and listened to the report on the promotion of the pilot work of "double repair" and "two cities" in Sanya, as well as the opinions and suggestions of relevant departments.
Liu Yigui fully affirmed the phased results achieved in the pilot work and the good experiences and good practices created.
Liu Yigui stressed that Sanya should firmly seize the opportunity of historical development, take the pilot work of "double repair" and "two cities" as an important starting point, and give full play to the leading role driven by demonstration in the province's economic and social development.
It is necessary to play a leading role in improving the internationalization level of international tourism islands, starting from the details, enriching international elements and creating international boutiques.
It is necessary to play a leading role in the integration of urban and rural areas and global tourism, accelerate the construction of characteristic small towns, integrate tourism elements into each project, and build every village and town in Sanya into tourist attractions.
It is necessary to play a leading role in the "100-day action of serving social investment", promote the construction of a number of major projects and parks, ensure the landing of high-quality projects, and implement the requirements of large-scale actions.
Zhang Qi, Secretary of the Standing Committee of the Provincial Party Committee and the Sanya Municipal Party Committee, Vice Governor Wang Lu, and Lu Zhiyuan, Secretary-General of the Provincial Government, participated in the research discussions.
In his 14-year sports career, Deng Yaping won a total of 18 world championships, becoming the first person in China's Olympic history to win four Olympic gold medals.
She has maintained the world's first for eight consecutive years in table tennis, and is the longest female athlete ranked "world's first" in the history of table tennis.
On September 26, 2010, he was deputy secretary-general of the People's Daily and general manager of the People's Search Network Joint Stock Company, with cadres at the office level.
A few days ago, she will work together with Yu Minhong to build the country's first sports industry innovation and entrepreneurship platform.
There is also such a group of star coaches in Chinese sports: they have unlimited scenery in the era of athletes and won countless honors for the country; after retiring, they have been taught for many years in latecomers and trained to win championships.
As the first world champion in Chinese men's gymnastics, Huang Yubin chose to pick up the teaching whip after retiring.
