The high-profile men's singles champion of the Beijing Olympic Games and Spanish superstar Nadal defeated their opponents in two straight sets in the men's singles competition on the same day, and the men's doubles competition also advanced to the final.
Nadal, as the winner of the golden slam, has a love for the Olympic Games, and he has not been healed, and this three-line attack has won a lot.
He and his teammate Lopez will compete for gold medals in the men’s doubles final with Romania’s Tekaou and Megia.
The women's singles project of the Rio Olympic Games encountered a number of seed players to retire, and after several days of fierce competition, all the women's singles were produced on the 11th.
Kvitova will compete with Puig for a ticket to the final, while another final spot will take place between Case and Kobel.
The women's doubles finals were also produced, and the semi-final matches were: Hingis/Basinski against Hradeka/Heravakova; Makalova/Vinina against Strikova/Safalova.
On this day, the mixed doubles competition also decided the top eight, but the top seed Mahu / Garcia combination of horses, as well as the withdrawal of the natto combination, so that the mixed doubles competition a little color.
On April 27, 2015, the United States and Japan jointly released a new version of the U.S.-Japan Defense Cooperation Guidelines in New York, allowing the Japanese armed forces to play a more offensive role around the world.
This is the day the U.S. Secretary of Defense Carter, U.S. Secretary of State Kerry, Japan's Foreign Minister Kishida Wenxiong and Japan's Defense Secretary Nakata attended a press conference in New York.
This is the fifth time that a Chinese private think tank has published an evaluation report on Japan's military strength, and it is also the 4th
The report is divided into nine chapters, including overall policy adjustment, military strength, defense budget, military deployment, weapons and equipment reform, institutional reform, military training exercises, foreign military security cooperation, and military security relations with China.
According to the report, 2015 is the year of the Abe government's phased end of promoting major policy adjustments in the field of security for several consecutive years.
Since then, Japan's measures in the field of security will mainly focus on the operational aspects of the application of the rule of law, strategic implementation, and policy implementation, rather than the substantial adjustments and changes in frameworks, mechanisms and policies.
According to the report, Abe's cabinet tried to achieve the multiple purposes of promoting Japan's "normal nationalization" through these three breakthroughs, the self-defense forces going out to intervene in international security affairs, and strengthening the Japan-U.S. alliance.
Previously, the China Association for the Promotion of Strategic Culture released Japan's military force assessment reports on June 5, 2012, July 19, 2013, July 23, 2014, and June 30, 2015.
On August 12, the British "Financial Times" released a set of atlases of the U.S. ambassador's residence in China.
In contrast, the U.S. ambassador’s residence, in terms of appearance, can be used as a security house in the next film adapted from John Le Carre’s Cold War spying novel.
The residence is grey and is closely guarded by perimeter fences, second inner walls, barbed wire and vehicle roadblocks.
Complementing the shortcomings of public sports facilities
The black coal farm warehouse has become a "green grass" football field; the factory building of the red brick spire has been transformed into a modern sports hall.
On the National Fitness Day, the South-Leasing Camp Sports and Culture Park outside the Wangjiang Gate in Hangzhou lifted the mysterious veil.
It used to be a coal farm, and it has been idle for more than a decade, leaving behind a lot of illegal buildings and domestic waste.
After rectification here, it has become a sports and cultural park, and will be officially opened to the public in November, providing free sports venues to the public, which has undoubtedly opened up a new fertile land for national sports.
I can't help but think of Hangzhou Chen Jinglong Sports School, the "Whampoa Military Academy" in the Chinese swimming stanks out of a number of world champions.
The name of the swimming world will continue to emerge, vividly interpreting the relationship between competitive sports and national sports - the rich mass base provides good conditions for the selection of professional players.
The level of competitive sports is closely related to the basis of national sports, which depends on national sports in a certain sense, and national sports depends on venue conditions.
According to reports, as of 2015, China's per capita stadium area has been 150 times that of the founding of New China, but it is still far behind the sports powers.
In June this year, the State Council issued the National Fitness Plan (2016-2020), focusing on the development of mass sports.
In order to make up for this short board, on the one hand, the relevant departments should take full account of the layout of sports venues when conducting urban planning.
On the other hand, public sports venues that have been built, including stadiums in units such as schools, should expand the scope of opening up as much as possible and improve the efficiency of use as much as possible.
At present, the Rio Olympic Games, which are in full swing, stimulate people's enthusiasm for sports, and awaken everyone's sense of participation.
Gilliad gets attorney's fee in battle with Merck's hepatitis C patent
According to U.S. District Judge’s decision, Guilled Sciences is entitled to legal fees arising from patent litigation with pharmaceutical company Merck Group’s hepatitis C in the United States.
In June, after a U.S. judge discovered that Mercke had committed violations, including perjury and other unethical acts, Gilled was exempted from $200 million in damages for Gilead’s best-selling drugs Sofsobwe and Haverney’s infringement of Mercker’s two patents.
In Thursday’s lawsuit, U.S. District Judge Beth Lamberson Freeman said Gilead did not have to bear the costs incurred as a result of his defense.
Merck is trying to catch up with Gilled, which dominates the market for next-generation hepatitis C drugs. Gilled's drugs can cure more than 90 percent of hepatitis patients.
The case dates back to 2013, when Gilead and Merck sued each other, and both claimed to be the owner of a laboratory work in Gilead’s drug, Sofsbuvir.
U.S.-backed forces announce they have recaptured Manbij from Islamic State.
A force spokesman said on Friday that all remaining Islamic State soldiers in the city had left, and U.S.-backed forces had taken full control of the northern city of Manbij, near the Turkish border.
The Syrian Democratic Forces (SDF) are now wreashing the entire city following the departure of militants who are hiding in the city.
Sharan Darwish of the Syrian Democratic Forces Alliance’s Manbij Military Committee told Reuters they had rescued more than 2,000 civilians who had been abducted by militants.
He told Reuters: "Manbij is now under our control, but we're still doing a sweep."
The Clintons earned $10.75 million in 2015 and paid 34.2 per cent of federal taxes.
Hillary Clinton on Friday released his 2105 tax returns, which showed that the Democratic presidential candidate and her husband earned $10.75 million in 2015 and paid 34.2 percent in federal taxes.
In 2015, the Clintons made $1 million in philanthropic donations, most of which went to the Clinton Foundation; former President Bill Clinton earned nearly $5.3 million for his speeches, while the former secretary of state earned $3 million from publishers Simon and Schuster with a book about her tenure at the State Department.
Clinton’s running mates, U.S. Senator Tim Kaine of the Commonwealth of Virginia, and his wife, Anne Holden, released 10 years of tax returns.
The two paid 20.3 percent of the federal tax in 2015.
Clinton's campaign aide, Jennifer Palmieri, said in a statement: "Hillary Clinton and Tim Kane will continue to serve as benchmarks for financial transparency."
In stark contrast, Donald Trump overshadowed and retracted his previous promises to publish his tax returns for false reasons.
Although the law is not required, it is customary for U.S. presidential candidates to make their tax returns public.
As a New York businessman, Trump, along with his lawyers, cited an IRS audit as a reason to refuse to release a tax return.
Clinton campaign aide Ian Sams said on Twitter that you are in charge, along with links to tax returns for Democratic candidates.
On Thursday, Trump’s special counsel, Michael Cohen, told CNN that he would not allow Trump to publish his tax returns until the audit was completed.
Critics of Trump, including 2012 Republican presidential candidate Mitt Romney and other Republicans, said Trump’s refusal to publish his tax returns would raise questions about his net worth of capital, philanthropic donations, business transactions and various other relationships, including relations with Russia.
Clinton seized on the issue and lashed out, releasing an online video on Friday highlighting high-profile Democrats urging Trump to release his taxes.
On Thursday, she raised the issue in an economic policy speech in Michigan.
“For decades, he refused to publish his tax returns, as other presidential candidates did.”
According to the Politician News Network, Trump paid almost no penny in taxes in the 1990s for two years in the 1990s, and the New York Times business columnist on Friday quoted a number of tax lawyers and accountants, all of whom said that this may still be the case.
Federal taxes have become a major issue in presidential campaigns.
Clinton named Warren Buffett, a billion-dollar investor, after a rule that guarantees at least 30 percent of taxes on people earning more than $1 million a year.
President Obama also supported the proposal.
Last week, Clinton held a rally in Omaha, Nebraska, where Berkshire Hathaway is based, where Buffett asked Trump to meet and exchange tax returns.
Buffett said he is also being audited by the IRS and that what Trump “fears” is not the tax authorities, but the voters.
The first tax returns released by the Clinton campaign were in 2007.
The Clintons, who currently live in Chaback, New York, paid an average federal tax rate of about 32 per cent between 2007 and 2014, and an overall rate of about 40.5 per cent.
The Clintons’ 2015 tax return showed that, unlike the majority of Americans, they earned only $100 in wages.
Their main investment is a low-cost index mutual fund, and the Clintons have a dividend and interest income of $109,000.
Reporting by Kevin Dowball; Editing by Jonathan Odiss
Jewish filmmaker criticises Berlin hotel for removing Israeli phone code in response to Arab customer's "requests" - Reuters News
A French filmmaker of Jewish descent told the media that the Kempinski Hotel in Berlin did not list Israel's telephone code, and the hotel staff said that this was according to the "demands" of Arab customers, which triggered an uproar in public opinion.
Claude Lanzmann, author of the Holocaust documentary Havoc, expressed his disappointment at the Kempinski Hotel and published an open letter in the Frankfurter Allgemeine Zeitung in Germany.
During his most recent stay, Longzman wanted to find Israel on the list of telephone codes at the hotel.
However, Israel is not among the countries where guests can speak directly from their rooms.
In 2016, Berlin, the capital of Germany, disappeared.
Langzmann wrote.
Instead, guests can make calls to Israel via the Kempinski Hotel’s call center.
In search of an explanation, the filmmaker inquired about the hotel’s front desk.
In his letter, Longzman said the response he received at the front desk "shocked him."
Hotel officials said it was “a deliberate decision by Kempinski’s management.”
And the reason for this makes the filmmaker even more angry.
Landzman quotes the employee’s words: “Most of our guests are Arabs who are demanding the removal of Israeli codes.”
According to the South German Daily, Israel’s ambassador to Germany, Yakov Khadas Handelsmann, called the incident a “glamorous disgrace.”
We were surprised to learn of the incident.
This in itself is a great shame.
And what happened in Germany and the hotel chain is even more embarrassing.
There is no need to explain this matter.
“We want the hotel to come to the right conclusions,” the official said.
This incident has sparked heated debate on the Internet, and everyone believes that this is a scandal.
It has been suggested that the Kempinski Hotel is simply “groveling” to meet the demands of Arab customers.
Another post pointed to the hotel’s “really shamelessness” and pointed out that the street, located on the famous Kudam Street, was near a synagogue.
According to Der Spiegel, the hotel was quick to clarify all the allegations, claiming that everything was “negligent” and “apologies” to Longzman.
The Südde Zeitung quoted Kempinski's representative as saying: "There has never been a direct order to remove Israel from the speed dial list."
The newspaper also said that the Israeli code has been added to the list.
Police use tear gas and rubber bullets to evict Brazilian students in protests
On Thursday, in Sao Paulo, Brazil, students clashed with police during protests against the government’s reform of the public education system.
Police used tear gas and rubber bullets to expel the protesters.
The incident stemmed from an attempt by law enforcement officials to disperse the students, so police used rubber bullets and tear gas.
Hundreds of students took part in the march, expressing their displeasure with these programs.
To save money, São Paulo Gov. Okmin plans to shut down 100 public schools and transfer 300,000 students.
Some of the students who participated in the protest expressed dissatisfaction with interim President Michel Temer through the graffiti on the walls.
Just a few days before the most recent protest, protesters took to the streets collectively in support of President Dilma Rousseff, who had been impeached by the National Senate.
Scottish Cyclist Karm Skinner returns after winning the gold medal in cycling.
Scottish cyclist Kalm Skinner last night at the Rio Cycling scenic men's team race helped the British trio successfully defend the Olympic gold medal after the 2012 London Olympics.
The 23-year-old Glasgow bicycler replaced his compatriot, Sir Chris Hoy, as the center of the team. Even the legendary cyclist was proud of him when the young Skinner defeated the favourite New Zealand.
Four years ago, the British team was amazing, and Hoy won the fifth of his six Olympic gold medals.
The British team finished sixth at London's World Cycling Field Championships in March, and Hoy retired. Then, the British team made another brilliance.
During the Beijing Olympics to the London Olympics, the British team's problem was to replace the "first round expert" Jamie Stuff.
That’s exactly what the team did when Cinders showed up.
Hoy’s retirement also left a gap, and both Chean Imadi and Matt Crampton wanted to fill that gap.
After seeing Skinner's potential, the British men's coaching staff insisted that he be selected into the national team, and Skinner finally lived up to expectations.
Skinner's partner was Sinders and Kenny, who won the gold medal with Hoy four years ago. The trio set an Olympic record in the qualifiers, but this result was surpassed by New Zealand in the first round.
These three British bicycle races finally defeated their opponents and won gold medals.
Although Hinders is slightly behind, Kenny takes the lead for the team, and Skinner keeps that lead until the end.
The change in strategy was the key to this reversal, and Hindes opted for the larger flywheel, so it was slower, which allowed Kenny, especially Skinner, to maintain speed.
Hoy watched the game as a BBC commentator. Skinner, Kenny and Hinders saw him on the podium.
Skinner, a 23-year-old Glasgow cyclist, said: "It flatters me."
I’m just doing what I can to make myself famous.
We set an Olympic record in the final and beat the world championship.
That's unbelievable.
There’s nothing better than this victory.
After winning gold with Kenny and Hoy at the 2012 London Olympics, Cinders admitted to deliberately falling on the track in a bad start.
Later, he retracted this comment, and the British opponents were unable to appeal.
There were no such problems with this victory.
“It’s like in London, the platforms are full of British flags.”
We just teamed up three months ago.
“We’ve lost a lot of world championships, so it’s amazing to be able to defend Olympic champions.
This is only a game and a gold medal for the British team, which won seven of the 10 venue cycling gold medals at the Beijing Olympics and the London Olympic Games.
If this symbolizes the progress we’ve made over the past five months, we’ll continue to be successful in the cycling hall over the next five days.
Depending on Kenny’s performance, it’s not impossible to reproduce Hoey’s feat of winning three gold medals at an Olympics.
If that’s the case, Behoi is 12 years younger and also on March 23 (which appears to be the sacred day of British sport, Steve Redgrave, Mo Farah and Roger Bannister was also born on that day) Kenny, who was born, will have six gold medals and a silver medal.
This achievement is the same as that of Hoy.
Kenney will start today with a three-day race.
The 28-year-old Bolton said: “I’m going to focus on this game for the moment.
The team game is always the best.
You can win the game with your teammates.
Frankly speaking, it’s a little lonely for a person to win.
Hinders said: “If he can win the other two gold medals, then he should have been awarded the jazz title”.
It’s the only game that produced medals on the day, but the British team received other good news.
Sir Bradley Wiggins, Ed Clancy, Steven Burke and Owen Düll advanced with the quickest four-kilometre group chase.
Their score was 351.943.
The world record for the 2012 Olympic gold medalist in London is 351.659.
The first round and the finals (10:42 p.m.) were held today for the second tournament, and Wiggins will undoubtedly be in the spotlight.
Yesterday, he had an argument with match officials before qualifiers, who asked him to measure his height.
In the women’s division, which will end tomorrow, Laura Trotter, Joanna Rossel Shande, Eleanor Barker and Kate Archibald from Milgay advanced with a new world record of 413.260.
The British team relied on the strong field cycling team to take the initiative in the middle of the Olympic Games and won a number of medals.
After showing its absolute dominance at the Beijing and London Olympics, the British Cycling team was slightly disappointed during their trip to Rio.
There have been a number of setbacks during this period, including the resignation of April's technical director Sean Sutton over sexist and bullying allegations and the retirement of legends such as Hoy and Victoria Pendleton.
However, the first racing night of the bicycle hall is enough to prove that the British team will once again stage the legend of reaching the peak of the key moment.
After the small life comes to this world, parents are responsible for this life, this responsibility is not only in the health of the child, but also in the development of the spirit, that is, education.
If you fail in the education of children, then even if the career is successful, it will not be able to make up for the shortcomings of life and the failure of the family.
When a new life arrives, the new parents need to spend time looking after and educating their children and taking responsibility for them.
And responsibility, in addition to being reflected in the care of the body, so that they are healthy, but also in the spiritual education, that is, to let the children learn how to be a person, how adults, how to succeed.
Good family education means that parents need to accompany their children regularly, care for their children, and care for them, and they also need to teach their children to develop civilized words and deeds, so that children can better learn knowledge and improve their intelligence.
The words and deeds of parents will affect the growth of their children, they will imitate their parents, that is, people often say that dragons, pheasants, rat sons will punch holes, what kind of parents what kind of children.
Therefore, parents in front of their children need to be a good example, standardize their own words and deeds, and cultivate their own excellent character, which can indirectly help the child to shape a good spirit and make him better.
Amy is a smart and beautiful girl.
She is extremous and lively, able to get along well with her friends, and has good adaptability to the environment.
But Amy has a little secret in her heart: she can’t keep her attention focused on the tasks she’s going to learn and work.
This secret has been with Amy for a long time. It's usually not a big problem."
Even through decentralized, modular time to learn and work, she can basically complete the task and achieve good results.
However, when the task is heavy and the time is tight, Amy feels great pain and torture.
The individual’s resistance to self-exposure and its emotional experience is designed not to threaten an individual’s self-awareness and self-esteem.
There are also behaviorist psychologists who understand impedance as an individual’s disobedience to the correction of their behavior.
I tried to get Amy to do an exercise that allowed her to calm herself through breathing and relax and feel the pain.
And once she left the trapped situation, she felt relaxed and regained her freedom.
The 63-year-old vagrant Han Mou had an argument with another vagabond Xiao after drinking, so he tied him to death with a knife.
Han said that before the incident, he and the vagabond Xiao lived on the ground in an alley in Dongcheng District, and the two were more than 20 meters apart.
Han said that on the day of the incident, they were called by their friends to drink together, and the two had two quarrels while eating and after meals.
Han said that he was afraid that Xiao would hit him, so he picked up a fruit knife from the garbage pile and killed him.
In court, the victim's family asked Han to compensate for funeral expenses, death compensation, etc. a total of more than 530,000 yuan.
Uber’s entry into the Taiwanese market for four years has had a significant impact on the local traditional taxi industry.
Taiwan's "United Daily News" reported on August 12 that more than 100 taxis bypassed Taiwan's "Administrative Yuan" on the morning of the 12th to protest, resulting in severe traffic paralysis in the vicinity.
Zheng Lijia, chairman of the Taipei driver's union, said Uber had been in Taiwan for four years, and the Taiwan authorities held a meeting at the end of this month, and drivers could no longer wait.
However, the government did not believe it, delaying it again and again.
Law-abiding taxi drivers who belong to the bottom of the class, but want to compete with the illegal but unrestricted Uber, feel cheated by the authorities.
Original title: 2000 chickens in a farm in Jiangsu were sentenced to be sold by the owner of the court seizure farm without authorization.
After the judgment came into effect, because Li did not automatically perform the obligations determined by the judgment, Wang applied to the Shuyang court for enforcement.
On October 16, 2014, the Shuyang court made a civil ruling, ruling that all of Li's farms were detained for 2,000 laying hens, which could not be transferred or sold without permission.
After receiving the detention ruling, Li privately sold some of the laying hens that had been detained on the farm without the permission of the Shuyang court.
As of March 8, 2015, during the investigation of the Shuyang County Public Security Bureau, there were only 142 laying hens left in the farm.
The reporter learned on August 12 that the organizing committee of the Beijing 2022 Winter Olympics and the Winter Paralympics issued a notice indicating that the Beijing Winter Olympic Organizing Committee inherited intellectual property rights such as the emblem and logo of the Beijing Winter Olympic Committee.
Without the permission of the Beijing Winter Olympic Organizing Committee, no one may use the emblem and logo of the Beijing Winter Olympic Committee for commercial purposes.
The person in charge of the Industrial Coordination Department of the National Development and Reform Commission pointed out here today that steel overcapacity is a global problem.
In recent years, China's capacity utilization rate is higher than the global average, and it is also higher than that of the United States, Europe and other countries and regions.
China has taken resolute and effective measures to resolve excess production capacity, and the results are gradually emerging.
The person in charge pointed out that on the global issue of steel overcapacity, the Party Central Committee and the State Council attached great importance to it.
All departments and all regions have actively implemented the deployment of the State Council and earnestly carried out their work to reduce crude steel production capacity by about 45 million tons this year.
Starting from China's national conditions, China does not encourage steel exports, on the contrary, it also takes a series of practical measures to control steel exports.
The person in charge stressed that the international trade of steel products is essentially a market behavior, which is due to the independent choice of the demand of the importing country and the comprehensive consideration of product cost performance by consumers.
The implementation of trade protection measures will not help to fundamentally solve the development problems of the global steel industry; on the contrary, it will only have a further impact on the international trade order.
Referring to the debt, the person in charge stressed that resolving the debt problem is an important issue that needs to be properly dealt with in the process of resolving excess capacity.
Due to the large-scale assets of steel enterprises, involving a wide range, the debt relationship of some enterprises is complex, and if it is improperly disposed of, it may lead to regional risks.
According to the person in charge, in recent years, as the downward pressure on the economy has increased, the total demand of society has gradually weakened, the capacity utilization rate of some industries has declined, and the production and operation difficulties of enterprises have increased.
Some enterprises do not adapt to the changes in the market environment, production and operation is unsustainable or even close to bankruptcy, but subject to some institutional and institutional factors, there are more obstacles to exit in a market-oriented way, becoming a "zombie enterprise".
The existence of such enterprises distorts market signals, reduces the efficiency of the utilization of factor resources, increases social management costs, and hinders the establishment of a fair competition market environment.
The main cause of the losses is the same as the difficulties faced by the global steel industry - weak market demand and low capacity utilization.
China mainly adopts market mechanisms, economic means and rule of law methods, and the government is mainly to do a good job of working with employees and social stability to ensure a fair and just market order.
The person in charge stressed that in the next step, we must unswervingly continue to do a good job in production capacity, and ensure the completion of the five-year target task of defusing the crude steel production capacity of 100 to 150 million tons.
On the afternoon of the 10th, as soon as China's tourism police debuted at Red Square in Moscow, they immediately attracted people's attention, and Chinese tourists waved with surprises, and locals and foreign tourists couldn't help but look back.
On the same day, members of China's first professional tourism police team, the tourism police detachment of the Public Security Bureau of Sanya City, Hainan Province, came to the Red Square in Moscow to exchange and study with the local tourism police on duty.
The Moscow tourist police were divided into three group patrols in Red Square, Nikolisky Pedestrian Street, Gum Department Store and other places, and the Chinese tourism police studied together with the post, which lasted for more than an hour.
Liu Shine, a female police officer in her twenties and fluent in English and Spanish this year, has just joined the tourist police force last year.
Along the way, he looked carefully at the words and deeds of his Russian counterparts and communicated with her from time to time.
Whit met Spanish tourists for consultation, the Moscow tourism police explained to each other patiently in fluent Spanish, which left a deep impression on Wang Bing.
“Everyone in Moscow’s tourist police knows a foreign language, and there will be more than two doors, which has touched us very much.”
"Hainan, as an international tourist island, is gradually attaching importance to attracting international tourists, and we hope to improve our ability to match the status of international tourism islands."
On the same day, before studying with the post, the Chinese tourism police also went to the Moscow City Tourism Police Brigade to communicate with their Russian counterparts.
“I often deal with Chinese tourists, and it’s great to see them coming to Russia.”
“The question they usually ask for is: how to go, where is a monument, how to rent it, how to get back to the hotel.”
Ressakov, captain of the Moscow City Tourism Police Group, said that in recent years, Moscow's urban environment and tourism atmosphere have become better and better, and the attraction for foreign tourists has increased.
In order to meet the needs of tourism development, a tourism police force was set up in July 2014, responsible for patrolling and defending major attractions to help and guide tourists.
At present, all Moscow tourist police are proficient in English, and some also speak Spanish and German.
The police team divided them into nine groups according to their foreign language level and took two classes a week to learn self-defense tricks, laws and regulations, and foreign languages.
"There are currently two travel police officers who have started to learn Chinese, and we still need to continue to improve their Chinese proficiency," Resakov said.
Ressakov told reporters that since the establishment of the Moscow tourism police, it has accumulated some experience and hopes to inspire Sanya counterparts.
He believes that the cooperation between the police departments of Russia and China will enhance the sense of security for their citizens to travel to each other's countries.
"The recruitment of personnel of Moscow's tourist police, the police model, the equipment, and the good interaction with the tourists have brought us a lot of inspiration," Chen Xiaokun said.
The reporter combed and found that at least nine provinces and cities such as Hebei, Jilin, Tianjin, Jiangxi, Sichuan, Hainan, Gansu, Fujian and Beijing have issued implementation rules for residence permits.
Regarding the conditions for applying for a residence permit, it is generally proposed in the above-mentioned areas that it is necessary to live for more than six months, which meets one of the conditions for legal and stable employment, legal and stable residence, and continuous study.
The reporter noted that in terms of the treatment provided by the residence permit, the "golden content" in various places varies, and compared with the provisions of the national version, the scope of public services and facilities provided in some areas has been expanded.
These areas have increased the convenience for children to participate in the local college entrance examination under the relevant conditions.
In addition, Beijing and other places have also made clear requirements to gradually expand the scope of providing public services and facilities, and regularly announce them to the public.
For example, Fujian proposed that at least every 3 years, the scope of public services and facilities enjoyed by holders of residence permits should be announced to the public.
According to the "Provisional Regulations" on residence permits, if they meet the conditions for handling residence permits, the public security organ shall, within 15 days from the date of acceptance, make and issue residence permits.
With regard to the time limit for the issuance of certificates, most of them are in line with the views of the national version, that is, it will be issued within 15 days.
Hebei made it clear that for those who meet the application conditions and have complete materials, the public security police station of residence should issue a residence permit within 3 working days from the date of acceptance.
Jiangxi stipulates that if the conditions for applying for a residence permit are met and the certification materials are complete, the public security organ shall, within 5 working days from the date of acceptance, make and issue a residence permit.
In accordance with the provisions of the Provisional Regulations on Residence Permits, the above-mentioned areas are clear, applying for a residence permit for the first time, and are exempted from the cost of certificate workers.
For example, Sichuan requires that local public security police stations or commissioned community service agencies should strictly implement the approved charging items and charging standards, and resolutely prohibit exceeding the scope, exceeding the standard charges, or riding fees.
